# Scripts

This directory contains the main scripts used for preprocessing, methylation analysis, and sequencing quality-control in the study.

## Structure

```text
Scripts/
├── Analysis/
│   └── Downstream processing and statistical comparison of methylation results.
│
├── Methylation/
│   └── Internal TE methylation and regional/flanking methylation workflows.
│
├── Preprocessing/
│   └── Preparation of RetroInspector-derived insertion inputs and genomic flanking regions.
│
└── Quality_Control/
    └── Auxiliary scripts for summarizing sequencing and alignment quality-control metrics.
